 flavor that you won't find in store-bought options.\n\n**Nutrients:**\nProtein: 27g per 100g.\nIron, Zinc, and Vitamin B6.\n\n**Health Benefits:**\n\nFor Kids: Essential for building strong muscles and a healthy immune system.\nFor Adults: High-quality lean protein that supports heart health and sustained energy.\n\n**Ways to Enjoy:**\nTraditional chicken curries, slow roasts, and grilled steaks.\nPerfect for making nourishing, flavor-rich soups and broths.","stockHistory":[{"newStock":487,"date":"2026-02-03T14:12:05.745Z","productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E","id":"btufwize4","note":"Sale - Bill: OR-16241","oldStock":488,"changeAmount":-1,"changedBy":"admin","actionType":"remove"},{"productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E","changeAmount":-1,"newStock":488,"oldStock":489,"note":"Sale - Bill: SL-32773","date":"2026-02-03T11:43:19.970Z","actionType":"remove","id":"0fhvb7d77","changedBy":"admin"},{"oldStock":490,"id":"glpbnqaim","productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E","actionType":"remove","note":"Sale - Bill: SL-88461","changeAmount":-1,"newStock":489,"changedBy":"admin","date":"2026-02-03T11:40:40.939Z"},{"note":"Sale - Bill: SL-69079","productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E","id":"ps1xgtjtt","changeAmount":-1,"oldStock":491,"newStock":490,"changedBy":"admin","date":"2026-02-03T11:35:51.529Z","actionType":"remove"},{"changeAmount":-1,"id":"2m68z7oa7","date":"2026-02-03T11:34:47.998Z","oldStock":492,"note":"Sale - Bill: SL-34970","actionType":"remove","newStock":491,"changedBy":"admin","productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E"},{"actionType":"remove","id":"hu159v5is","date":"2026-02-03T11:18:49.011Z","note":"Sale - Bill: SL-8985","newStock":492,"changeAmount":-1,"productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E","changedBy":"admin","oldStock":493},{"actionType":"remove","oldStock":494,"changedBy":"admin","note":"Sale - Bill: OR-80953","id":"t1gi4tp54","changeAmount":-1,"productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E","newStock":493,"date":"2026-02-03T06:42:25.072Z"},{"actionType":"remove","productId":"kVcj9iywEir7OvzpSp3E",